# TURKISH GET-UP

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Turkish Get-Up (TGU) is a whole-body movement performed by transitioning from a supine position to standing while maintaining a load overhead.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the most comprehensive integrated movement exercises, simultaneously developing mobility, stability, coordination and strength.

---

# Philosophy

Athletic performance depends on the ability to move efficiently through multiple positions while maintaining control.

The Turkish Get-Up develops this ability better than almost any single exercise.

CAS selects the TGU to build resilient, coordinated and highly adaptable athletes.

